Package: libtree-sitter0.26
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: incremental parsing library for programming tools
 Tree-sitter builds concrete syntax trees and efficiently updates them as
 source files are edited. This package contains the C runtime library.
 .
 This Qore backport does not include the Rust bindings or parser generator.

Package: libtree-sitter-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libtree-sitter0.26 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: incremental parsing library development files
 Tree-sitter builds concrete syntax trees and efficiently updates them as
 source files are edited. This package contains headers, static libraries,
 and pkg-config metadata for developing against the C runtime.
